sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant OGX as OGX Server<br/>:8321/TCP
    participant Provider as Inference Provider<br/>(vLLM/Bedrock/WatsonX/etc.)
    participant VectorDB as Vector Store<br/>(Milvus/pgvector/Qdrant)
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>(kv_postgres + sql_postgres)
    participant S3 as S3 Storage
    participant WebSearch as Web Search<br/>(Brave/Tavily)
    participant MCP as MCP Server
    participant OTEL as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector

    Note over Client,OTEL: Flow 1: Inference Request
    Client->>OGX: POST /inference (or /messages)<br/>HTTP :8321
    OGX->>OGX: Messages API translates<br/>Anthropic ↔ OpenAI Chat format
    OGX->>Provider: Forward to configured provider<br/>(env-var activated)
    Provider-->>OGX: Inference response
    OGX->>PG: Log inference to sql_postgres
    OGX-->>Client: Response (JSON)

    Note over Client,OTEL: Flow 2: Vector Search
    Client->>OGX: POST /vector_io<br/>HTTP :8321
    OGX->>VectorDB: Query vector store
    VectorDB-->>OGX: Search results
    OGX->>PG: Persist metadata (kv_postgres)
    OGX-->>Client: Vector search results

    Note over Client,OTEL: Flow 3: File Processing
    Client->>OGX: POST /files<br/>HTTP :8321
    OGX->>OGX: Process via docling/markitdown/pypdf
    alt S3 storage configured
        OGX->>S3: Store file
    else Local storage
        OGX->>OGX: Store to /opt/app-root/src/.ogx/distributions/rh/files
    end
    OGX->>PG: Store metadata in files_metadata table
    OGX-->>Client: File upload confirmation

    Note over Client,OTEL: Flow 4: Tool Execution
    Client->>OGX: POST /tool_runtime<br/>HTTP :8321
    alt Web search tool
        OGX->>WebSearch: Search query (Brave/Tavily)
        WebSearch-->>OGX: Search results
    else File search tool
        OGX->>OGX: Internal files API search
    else MCP tool
        OGX->>MCP: MCP protocol call
        MCP-->>OGX: Tool result
    end
    OGX-->>Client: Tool execution result

    Note over Client,OTEL: Flow 5: Container Startup (Secret Resolution)
    Note right of OGX: entrypoint.sh resolves 18<br/>_FILE secret variants from<br/>Kubernetes-mounted files →<br/>exports as env vars →<br/>launches OGX server

    Note over Client,OTEL: Flow 6: Telemetry
    OGX->>OTEL: Traces + Metrics (OTLP)<br/>when OTEL_SERVICE_NAME is set
